    the current limit maintained by the context. The driver is free to modify
    the requested value to meet h/w requirements (this could be clamping to
    minimum or maximum values, rounding up to nearest element size, etc). The
    application can use :func:`ctx_get_limit` to find out exactly what the
    limit has been set to.

