    by the ``printf()`` device system call. Setting
    ``CU_LIMIT_PRINTF_FIFO_SIZE`` must be performed before launching any kernel
    that uses the ``printf()`` device system call, otherwise
    ``CUDA_ERROR_INVALID_VALUE`` will be returned.

