    initial setting (currently, four bytes).

    - ``CU_SHARED_MEM_CONFIG_FOUR_BYTE_BANK_SIZE``: set shared memory bank
    width to be natively four bytes.

    - ``CU_SHARED_MEM_CONFIG_EIGHT_BYTE_BANK_SIZE``: set shared memory bank
    width to be natively eight bytes.

    Args:
        config (Sharedconfig): requested shared memory configuration.

    .. seealso:: `cuCtxSetSharedMemConfig`
    """
    with nogil:
        __status__ = cuCtxSetSharedMemConfig(<CUsharedconfig>config)
    check_status(__status__)


