    a call to ``cudaMalloc``, may be unsafe. In the case of ``cudaMalloc``, the
    operation is not enqueued asynchronously to a stream, and is not observed
    by stream capture. Therefore, if the sequence of operations captured via
    ``cuStreamBeginCapture`` depended on the allocation being replayed whenever
    the graph is launched, the captured graph would be invalid.

