    a function may be queried using ``cuFuncIsloaded``. ``cuFuncLoad`` may be
    called to explicitly load a function before querying the following
    attributes that require the function to be loaded:.

    - ``CU_FUNC_ATTRIBUTE_MAX_THREADS_PER_BLOCK``.

    - ``CU_FUNC_ATTRIBUTE_CONST_SIZE_BYTES``.

    - ``CU_FUNC_ATTRIBUTE_MAX_DYNAMIC_SHARED_SIZE_BYTES``.

    Args:
        attrib (FunctionAttribute): Attribute requested.
