    a different configuration if required to execute ``hfunc``. Any context-
    wide preference set via :func:`ctx_set_cache_config` will be overridden by
    this per-function setting unless the per-function setting is
    ``CU_FUNC_CACHE_PREFER_NONE``. In that case, the current context-wide
    setting will be used.

