    Note that this call will return ``CUDA_ERROR_OUT_OF_MEMORY`` if there are
    insufficient resources required to perform the bind. This call may also
    return ``CUDA_ERROR_SYSTEM_NOT_READY`` if the necessary system software is
    not initialized or running. This call may return
    ``CUDA_ERROR_ILLEGAL_STATE`` if the system configuration is in an illegal
